  "read-00": {
    "file": "read-00.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "The PE teacher is talking to her students about Pelé.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "84c36af41cb90602"
  },
  "read-01": {
    "file": "read-01.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Today we're going to talk about Pelé. Do you know him?",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "3cd3fbcaec817d7b"
  },
  "read-02": {
    "file": "read-02.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Yes, I think he's the best footballer of all time.",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "60ff115039333854"
  },
  "read-03": {
    "file": "read-03.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Right. He was born in nineteen forty in Brazil. His father taught him to play football at a very young age.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "45ce075827eb43ef"
  },
  "read-04": {
    "file": "read-04.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Oh. When did he begin his career in football?",
    "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "420aa0a1ff5f45de"
  },
  "read-05": {
    "file": "read-05.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "At fifteen, when he started playing for Santos Football Club. In nineteen fifty-eight, he won his first World Cup.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "d0e429db8fc98446"
  },
  "read-06": {
    "file": "read-06.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "How many goals did he score in his career?",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "7de9fa447341f472"
  },
  "read-07": {
    "file": "read-07.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "One thousand two hundred and eighty-one goals in total, I think.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "8dcb71b7d4a93ca1"
  },
  "read-08": {
    "file": "read-08.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Wow! Amazing!",
    "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "285d88ce6837f3f4"
  },
  "read-09": {
    "file": "read-09.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "And he became \"Football Player of the Century\" in nineteen ninety-nine.",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "c12f0716651af053"
  },
  "read-10": {
    "file": "read-10.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Surely Pelé's a national hero in Brazil.",
    "voice": "en-GB-ThomasNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "96d038af80c34434"
  },
  "read-11": {
    "file": "read-11.mp3",
    "kieu": "don",
    "text": "Yes, and he's known around the world as \"The King of Football\".",
    "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
    "rate": "+0%",
    "bam": "bfbcad1314977fc2"
  },
